{"title": "True Strike Riposte", "pageid": 28113, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/True_Strike_Riposte", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>True Strike Riposte</b> is a passive feature that lets the wielder retaliate against a missed attack.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When a creature misses you with a melee attack, you may retaliate and gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/True_Strike_(Condition)\" title=\"True Strike (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"True Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/True_Strike_(Condition)\" title=\"True Strike (Condition)\">True Strike</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=